data: {"id": "4f70617d9bba4040-final", "run_id": "4f70617d9bba4040", "seq": 1801, "ts_ms": 1789363955393, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v12/workload` | Terminating | {'type': 'Initialized', 'status': 'True'} |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `phase: Running`, `ContainersReady: True`, `Ready: True`, `PodScheduled: True` (fact-1b582764e373 ~ fact-99e006dfb49f) | 确认 Pod 内部逻辑与网络状态完好，与 Terminating 状态形成明显异常对比 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | `app container memory limit: 32Mi`, `cpu limit: 50m` (fact-50b46bffcc17, fact-b29187d5c2a8) | 提供资源边界上下文，排除因资源超限导致的 OOM 或 CPU 节流 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.app restart_count: 0` (fact-cc6b990b5874) | 排除应用频繁崩溃重启导致 Terminating 状态异常的可能 |\n| 4 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `application started` (fact-8ec0f8c16c20) | 证实应用已正常启动，但未记录到终止期相关的日志输出 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{container=\"app\"}: 0` (fact-21dbb9b0acb0) | 指标与 K8s State 一致，进一步确认运行平稳且无重启发生 |\n| 6 | Tracing | Deepflow/Tempo | 无数据 (status: absent) | 缺失链路追踪数据，无法确认终止请求的到达路径及处理细节 |\n\n**证据交叉分析：**\n- 证据 1 (K8s 状态) 与证据 4/5 (日志/指标) 共同证实应用处于“完美运行”的活跃状态，没有任何崩溃或资源争用的迹象。\n- 这种应用内部的“活跃”与 K8s 层面的“终止中”状态不一致，通常由 `preStop` 钩子卡死、存储卷卸载缓慢或外部强杀（HardKill）前的宽限期等待引起。由于缺少证据 6 (Tracing) 以及 Bash 探查文件存在性失败，导致无法判断是应用逻辑阻塞还是底层基础设施延迟。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 被触发 Terminating (deletionTimestamp) → Kubelet 发送 Killing 信号 (等待 3900s 宽限期) → 终止状态卡死 (应用状态却显示为 Running) → 应用逻辑未执行完毕、未执行 PreStop、或存储卷卸载卡死 → 用户可见：Pod 长期保持 Terminating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**证据不足**。\n现有事实证实了应用内部在终止期间仍保持 `Running` 状态且未重启，但无法确定终止过程中的具体阻塞点。\n\n主要缺失的关键事实包括：\n1. **缺乏 PreStop Hook 证据**：无相关日志 (Fact 4 缺失) 或 Tracing 数据 (Fact 6 缺失)，无法判断 Hook 是否执行、执行耗时或是否被卡住。\n2. **缺乏文件/存储状态探查结果**：用于排查应用依赖文件（如 `/state/teardown-requested`）的工具执行失败 (Input validation error)，且缺失 Topology 查询结果，导致无法确认应用是否因“找不到预期文件”而卡住。\n3. **缺乏宽限期内的状态变化**：3900秒宽限期内无日志记录，无法区分是等待钩子完成还是等待底层挂载卷卸载完成。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 46.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v12/workload: 46.2s (Evidence 36.5s, RCA 9.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v12/workload**: pod-terminating-stuck\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 75.893, "metrics": {"run_id": "4f70617d9bba4040", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 75.90195894241333, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-terminating-stuck", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-terminating-stuck"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 75901.95894241333, "llm_calls": 11, "llm_duration_ms": 71642.75407791138, "tool_calls": 13, "executed_tool_calls": 13, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 13206.453800201416, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3998.8040924072266}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 17803.051233291626, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 46216.82643890381, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 11853.064060211182, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

